Z||000000||Pyric||12-16-2001||09:05 PM||||Okay, So I finally get the intake back in my car after replacing the vacuum line's with Rodney's Steel ones and repairing the hole in my EGR tube... I got to start the car and guess what?<P>The engine turns over once, dies and then the lights go out in the dash and it barley tries to crank. Turns out the battery is dead.<P>GRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>I might have finally fixed my problem and now I have to wait for the Battery to recharge before I can be sure.<P>This bites.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Sorry, had to vent.  I pulled a marathon run at putting the engine back together today and now it comes to a screeching halt.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieronegS.jpg">   <P><BR>"Never offend people with style when you can offend them with substance." <BR>--Sam Brown||||reg||1
