Z||000003||Pyric||12-16-2001||09:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierokid87:<BR><B>How are the vacume lines?  Any pictures other then whats on Rodney's site?  Im looking into these scince mine all broke.<P>Scott<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The vacuum lines are sweet.  I got the stainless ones and they rock.  Had to a just a few of them and some were a PITA to get in there.  (probably should have read Rodney's instructions first  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)  but considering it will be a LONG time before I have to worry about a vacuum leak, they were well worth it.  <P>I'll try and take some pictures when I get a chance.  I painted all the shields and lines up nice and pretty.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
