Z||000005||Pyric||12-17-2001||06:41 PM||||Yeah I sent it, I just sent you an e-mail a second ago.  It should be showing up in 2-3 days (according to them)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>Good news is, I just ran it for 20 minutes and I had no more glow!!! That's right, the exhaust doesn't even get dark red.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Now I just have to get it tagged.  (in NC they pull your tag if you haven't gotten your emissions on time.)  The car was "Kind of" unable to run, let alone pass emissions at the time.||||reg||1
